Definitions hold the data and stats for teams, players, seasons, and so on.

Classes:

Season - Data regarding the current season.
* Standings
* Schedule
* Team Seasonal Stats
* Current Week
* Completed Games

League - Data regarding the League in general. I
* List of Teams
* League-Wide Rules
* Season History
* GLobal Settings

Team - Data regarding information for the team this season.
* Players
* Team-Level Stats
* Record
* Strategy Profile

Player - Data and stats regarding information for the player this season.
* Attributes
* Current Season Stats
* Fatigue State
* Injury State

Game - Data and stats regarding information for a single game.
* Score
* Time
* Events Log
* Player Stats